    <briefdescription>
<para>Maps key presses to actions via direct and modal (prefix) bindings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Direct bindings (e.g. cmd+t) fire immediately. Modal bindings require the prefix key first, then the action key within a timeout window. Actions are registered as void() callables keyed by <ref refid="classjuce_1_1Identifier" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::Identifier</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
